  "data.q1cwhy": ["Eine Kippe kann rund 40 Liter Grundwasser belasten. Deshalb die Taschenaschenbecher.","One cigarette butt can contaminate around 40 litres of groundwater. That is why pocket ashtrays help.","Bir izmarit yaklaşık 40 litre yeraltı suyunu kirletebilir. Bu yüzden cep küllüğü kullanılır.","قد تلوّث عقب سيجارة نحو 40 لترًا من المياه الجوفية. لذلك تفيد منافض الجيب.","Jedan opušak može zagaditi oko 40 litara podzemne vode. Zato pomažu džepne pepeljare.","Un mozzicone può contaminare circa 40 litri di acqua sotterranea. Ecco perché servono i posacenere tascabili.","Eine Kippe kann etwa 40 Liter Grundwasser verschmutzen. Ein Taschen-Aschenbecher hilft."],
